### Create menu item
POST http://localhost:3000/api/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "sides": ["pasta", "garlic bread"]
}

### Get menu list
http://localhost:3000/api/menu

### Get current month menu list
http://localhost:3000/api/menu/current

### Get month menu
http://localhost:3000/api/menu/January/2026

### Get month menu
http://localhost:3000/api/menu/months